  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Build a production-quality Javascript React app using .js / .jsx files with Tailwind CSS & Lucide React / Phosphor icons.",
    "Implement the 10 core navigation views + Action Center + Onboarding flow + Global Ask AHONIX drawer overlay.",
    "Use Emerald (#10B981) for primary actions, success indicators, and growth metrics.",
    "Every metric card must clearly indicate if data is [ACTUAL], [ESTIMATED], [PROJECTED], [FORECAST], or [DEMO].",
    "Add interactive state management for approving actions in Action Center, triggering the Business X-Ray scanner, and conversing with Ask AHONIX analyst.",
    "Ensure all buttons, tabs, inputs, cards, and modal triggers have proper data-testid attributes."
